  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Futuremakers Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on employment (including both waged and self-employment) for young people with disabilities. It focuses on how labour market systems can adapt to be more inclusive of people with disabilities in formal employment and increasing the disability and employment confidence of employers, job seekers and supporting functions. It is built on a model tested in Kenya and other markets over the past three years, under Sightsavers&#x2019; UK Aid funded Inclusion Works programme.</narrative>
  </description>
